{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Brave Story","When 11 year old Wataru's father leaves home and his mother is taken ill to hospital, he decides to change his fate by travelling through the door shown to him by his friend Mitsuru. In a land of magic and monsters, Wataru must summon all his courage and embark on a journey with several comrades to meet the Goddess of Destiny and change this \"mistaken fate\".\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["ブレイブ・ストーリー",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-1681","ids":{"shikimori":1681,"mal":1681,"anilist":1681,"kodik":"movie-106678"},"kodikIds":["movie-9978","movie-43026","movie-106678"],"kodikRevisions":{"movie-9978":"2019-11-20T16:36:24Z","movie-43026":"2019-09-29T07:45:10Z","movie-106678":"2024-10-17T23:28:01Z"},"title":"Отважное сердце","originalTitle":"Brave Story","alt":"ブレイブ・ストーリー Brave Story ブレイブ・ストーリー","description":"Когда отец одиннадцатилетнего Ватару уходит из дома, а мать ложится в больницу, он решает изменить свою судьбу. Ватару идёт через дверь, которую показал ему его новый друг Мицуру . В стране магии и монстров Ватару должен проявить всё своё мужество в путешествии с несколькими товарищами к Богине Судьбы и изменить «ошибки судьбы».","year":2006,"type":"MOVIE","genres":["Экшен","Приключения","Фэнтези","исэкай"],"rating":7.4,"popularity":9931,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/1681/614a114168ec8adc820bc22ae9a05219.jpeg","width":700,"height":990},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1681-mRibcfxIyCaV.jpg","width":1900,"height":600}},"releasedEpisodes":[1],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-674","dubId":"674","label":"Люб. Одноголосый","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"movie-9978","translationId